One-second self-buff granting Enhanced Parry (Sword) +3 and Enhanced Time Sense [60] while the practitioner enters absolute defensive stillness.  Dead Calm occupies the practitioner's Jutsu selection for the action cycle, trading access to offensive Jutsu for extreme defense.
